-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",320,{
[10209]="7005AFFD\n1\tReflect upon a tale of Azanulbizar using the reflecting pool at Amdân\tThe Azanulbizar Reflecting Pool can be found at Amdân. You should reflect upon any of the following tales at the Azanulbizar Reflecting Pool to advance this quest: 'Nár's Tale', 'Council of the Seven', 'Bonds of Oak and Iron', 'The Lord of Moria', or 'A Final Reckoning'.\n2\tTalk to Hermáth Stormhammer at Amdân\tHermáth Stormhammer can be found at Amdân. You have reflected upon one of the tales of Azanulbizar as recounted by Hermáth Stormhammer. You should talk to Hermáth Stormhammer.\n",
[10210]="7006023E\n1\tThe Gundabad Reflecting Pool can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset. NOTE: Complete any instance at the Gundabad Reflecting Pool to advance this quest.\t\n2\tTalk to Agátur the Boastful at Steepset\tAgátur can be found at Steepset in Máttugard. You should talk to Agátur.\n",
[10211]="70059D2A\n1\tTalk to Glóin at Annâk-khurfu\tGlóin can be found in the war-room at Annâk-khurfu in Elderslade. You should talk to Glóin. NOTE: Mission Recruiters are available to deliver you there with haste. Mission Recruiters can be found at Thorin's Gate, Gondamon, Bree-town, The Twenty-first Hall, Othrikar, Gabilshathûr, Glóin's Camp, Hrimbarg, Galtrev, The Dolven-view, Magh Ashtu, Járnfast, Erebor, and Minas Tirith (Midsummer).\n",
[10212]="700160E8\n1\tTalk to Auti near the grodbog hive\tAuti is camped just north of the grodbog hive, west of the mirror, in the southern cavern of Redhorn Lodes. Auti will be pleased to hear that the mirror in the Redhorn Lodes has been re-aligned.\n",
[10213]="7004DA67\n1\tAid Bráthi with 'Essays of Old'\030Aid Dís with 'The Ravens of the North'\030Aid King Thorin III with 'Forging Trust'\tKing Thorin III and Bráthi can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain. Dís can be found at Raven Hill, to the south-west of Erebor. King Thorin III has asked you to aid him in restoring Erebor and unifying the Stout-axes and Longbeards.\n2\tTalk to King Thorin III\tKing Thorin III can be found in the Hall Under the Mountain. You have done much to aid King Thorin and his folk, and you should now return to him.\n",
[10214]="700430D0\n1\tTravel to Tumladen in Upper Lebennin\tTumladen can be found in northern Upper Lebennin. Faltharan has asked you to meet him in Tumladen in Upper Lebennin.\n2\tTalk to the gate-ward of Tumladen\tThe gate-warden can be found immediately outside Tumladen in northern Upper Lebennin. You have arrived at Tumladen and have been sighted by one of the gate-wardens. You should speak to him before attempting to enter the refuge.\n3\tKneel before the gate-ward and swear your loyalty to Gondor\tThe gate-warden can be found immediately outside Tumladen in northern Upper Lebennin. The gate-warden of Tumladen has questioned your intent. You should kneel and declare your loyalty to the people of Gondor.\n4\tFind Faltharan in Tumladen\tFaltharan can be found somewhere within Tumladen. You have been granted entry to Tumladen and should now seek out Faltharan.\n",
[10215]="70041867\n1\tTravel east to Erynos\tErynos can be found far to the east of Ost Anglebed near the confluence of the rivers Celos and Sirith. Nimithil has asked you to travel to Erynos to learn if the people there are still safe from the Corsair occupation of Pelargir.\n2\tTalk to someone in Erynos about the Corsair threat\tErynos can be found far to the east of Ost Anglebed near the confluence of the rivers Celos and Sirith. You have discovered Erynos unharmed by the forces of the Enemy and should now speak to one of its inhabitants.\n",
[10216]="70026746\n1\tTalk to Elrond in Rivendell\tYou have been called to Rivendell, in the Trollshaws, for there is much to do there.\n",
[10217]="7001AAA0\n1\tSpeak with Haldir at his talan\tThe talan of Haldir is at the banks of the Nimrodel, south of the road that leads to the broken bridge. Meredhrandir at Mekhem-bizru has urged you to seek the protection of Haldir before you come to harm so near the stirring mouth of Moria.\n",
[10218]="70030412\n1\tGather unspoiled food-stores from Langhold (total: 8)\tThe ruins of Langhold may yet hold some food left behind by the refugees ere they fled. You should search the homes of Langhold for unspoiled food that may have been left behind.\n2\tBring the unspoiled food to Cíllan\tCíllan is waiting in the Refugee Camp outside Harwick. You should bring the food you gathered to Cíllan.\n",
[10219]="700033B0\n1\tTalk to Griffo Boffin\tGriffo Boffin may be found at his home near the centre of Needlehole, to the north of Michel Delving. The easiest road to Needlehole runs north from Waymeet, the cross-roads east of Michel Delving. Mayor Whitfoot's assistant has asked you to investigate the disappearance of the money that was set aside for refurbishing Town Hole in Michel Delving.\n2\tCollect the money bag\tThe dwarves came out of the Rushock Bog to the east, between Needlehole and Overhill. Their camp is somewhere nearby, behind tall wooden bulwarks. You spoke with Griffo Boffin about the missing money, as Assistant Fallohide requested, and discovered that ruffian dwarves may have stolen it. Griffo asked that you seek out the dwarves' camp, retrieve the money bag, and bring it to Assistant Fallohide in Michel Delving.\n3\tTalk to Assistant Fallohide\030Collect Money-bag\tYou found the missing money, so now it should be delivered to Assistant Fallohide in Michel Delving.\n",
[10220]="7002EE56\n1\tTalk to Ingmar in the infirmary of Eaworth\tLord Ingmar lies wounded in the infirmary of Eaworth. Reeve Ingbert has asked you to check on the well-being of his son and to convey his pride to him.\n2\tTalk to Tóla at Ingmar's house in Eaworth\tLady Tóla is at Ingmar's house in the northern part of Eaworth. Ingmar asked you to bring reassurance to Lady Tóla in light of his victory and his grandmother's betrayal.\n3\tTalk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth\tReeve Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth. Tóla asked you to leave her alone. You should return to Reeve Ingbert and let him know the welfare of his son and Tóla's distress.\n",
[10221]="7002EE57\n1\tTalk to Ingmar in the infirmary of Eaworth\tLord Ingmar lies wounded in the infirmary of Eaworth. Reeve Ingbert has asked you to check on the well-being of his son and to convey his pride to him.\n2\tTalk to Tóla at Ingmar's house in Eaworth\tLady Tóla is at Ingmar's house in the northern part of Eaworth. Ingmar asked you to bring reassurance to Lady Tóla in light of his victory and his grandmother's betrayal.\n3\tTalk to Ingbert in the Mead Hall of Eaworth\tReeve Ingbert is in the Mead Hall of Eaworth. Tóla asked you to let Reeve Ingbert know that her heart is at peace.\n",
[10222]="70048C81\n1\tTalk to Rhadrog\tRhadrog can be found at Viznak's hideout in southern Agarnaith. You should go check on Rhadrog.\n2\tTalk to Viznak\tViznak can be found in his hideout. You should talk to Viznak.\n3\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron can be found in Viznak's hideout. You should talk to Faeron.\n",
[10223]="7003A69E\n1\tSpeak with Thane Nothmar\tNothmar is with Herubrand in the cellar of the farmhouse in Woodhurst. Herubrand has asked that you speak with Thane Nothmar to be sure his men are prepared for a battle for the mead hall in Woodhurst.\n2\tSpeak with Gifemund\tGifemund is in the ore refinery building near the centre of Woodhurst. Herubrand has asked that you speak with Gifemund to gather and prepare his men for a battle for the mead hall in Woodhurst.\n",
[10224]="7005981F\n1\tRelease wolf cubs (total: 4)\030Defeat Wildwood Cub Burglars (total: 8)\tPoachers can be found in the south-eastern Wildwood. Linnet has asked you to rescue wolf cubs who have been captured by poachers.\n2\tReturn to Linnet\tLinnet can be found in the south-central Wildwood. You should return to Linnet.\n",
[10225]="7006AED1\n1\tCollect relics from cultists in Kamrabezûr (total: 8)\tRecover relics from cultists spread throughout Kamrabezûr.\n2\tTalk to Azrât in Kên Taghlim\tAzrât is at Kên Taghlim in Kamrabezûr. Now that you have collected the relics, you should return them to her.\n",
[10226]="700173D2\n1\tDeliver the coins and relics to Hafberg at the Deep Descent\030Collect relics of the Treasury (total: 4)\030Collect dwarf-coins (total: 12)\tThe Forgotten Treasury is in Menem-berej, directly south of the Deep Descent. You should search the Orcs and any spoiled ruins for relics or coins of the Forgotten Treasury. Hafberg would prefer that you not unearth any that may still be lying about untouched.\n",
[10227]="70030432\n1\tDefeat a draugar\tDraugar can be found in Dwolung Hole in the Wold. You should defeat draugar and collect the relics they carry.\n2\tCollect relics from Draugar (total: 8)\tDraugar can be found in Dwolung Hole in the Wold. You should defeat draugar and collect the relics they carry.\n3\tShow the relics to Céolstan\tCéolstan stands in the stables of Harwick. You should bring the relics to Céolstan.\n",
[10228]="7000A119\n1\tCollect Broken Shield\030Collect Broken Sword\030Collect Time-worn Vase\tBarad Tharsír is south-east of Tinnudir, in the Barandalf, on the far side of the Brandywine. Harmony Grayson wants you to bring her any relics that you can find from Barad Tharsír.\n2\tBring old relics to Harmony Grayson\tHarmony Grayson is at the Ranger camp on the island of Tinnudir, north-west of the Barandalf and west of Parth Aduial. You have gathered several relics from the ruins of Barad Tharsír and should return to Harmony Grayson.\n3\tBring old relics to Astiul\tRanger Astiul is at the Ranger-camp on the island of Tinnudir, north-west of the Barandalf and west of Parth Aduial. Harmony Grayson has asked you to bring the relics you collected to Astiul, as he will appreciate their significance.\n4\tTalk to Harmony Grayson\tHarmony Grayson is in the Ranger-camp on the island of Tinnudir, north-west of Barandalf and west of Parth Aduial. Astiul has expressed his gratitude for your efforts and wants you to thank Harmony for him.\n",
[10229]="70025A37\n1\tCollect a shield\030Collect a sword\030Collect a vase\tBarad Tharsír is south-east of the colossus, in the Barandalf, on the far side of the Brandywine. Daerol wants you to bring him any relics that you can find from Barad Tharsír.\n2\tBring old relics to Daerol at the colossus\tDaerol is at the Ranger-camp at the colossus, north-west of the Barandalf and west of Parth Aduial. You have gathered several relics from the ruins of Barad Tharsír and should return to Daerol.\n",
[10230]="7004E929\n1\tRecover Zhélruka relics (total: 12)\tYou should recover Zhélruka relics from thawed soil on the Withered Heath.\n2\tBring the relics to Hórin\tYou should bring the relics to Hórin in Skarháld.\n",
[10231]="700608AB\n1\tComplete \"The Lost Treasures of Haudh Erthaid\"\030Complete \"The Crumbling Halls of Glynafon\"\tComplete quests in the Angle for Narnien: \"The Lost Treasures of Haudh Erthaid\" \"The Crumbling Halls of Glynafon\"\n2\tReturn to Narnien\tNarnien is located in Gaerond, in the northern Angle. You should tell Narnien that you have found enough artifacts for her studies to continue.\n",
[10232]="7003E2AF\n1\tDefeat goblins in Nan Wathren (quantity: see journal)\tRelics of Meluinen can be found on goblins and in caches in central Nan Wathren, in the southern North Downs. You should collect the stolen relics of Meluinen, so that they may someday be returned. Small Fellowship Recommended.\n2\tCollect Relics of Meluinen (total: 25)\tRelics of Meluinen can be found on goblins and in caches in central Nan Wathren, in the southern North Downs. You should collect the stolen relics of Meluinen, so that they may someday be returned.\n3\tCompleted\tYou have defeated a number of goblins from Nan Wathren.\n",
[10233]="7001AACE\n1\tFind Silvan relics (total: 5)\tRelics might be found within Minas Gîl, east of Ost Galadh. Agorin has asked you to recapture Silvan relics from the sorcerers in Minas Gîl.\n2\tTalk to Agorin at Ost Galadh\tAgorin is at Ost Galadh, west of Minas Gîl. You should bring the relics you found to Agorin.\n",
[10234]="70000CA8\n1\tReturn the relics to Arienh\030Collect relics from Agamaur (total: 15)\tArienh is encamped at the entrance to the area called Garth Agarwen. She asked that you search the areas outside of the barrows, arboretum, and fortress of Garth Agarwen for trinkets that will help provide for the Eglain. Arienh asked that you watch for relics of the ancient days as you venture within Garth Agarwen.\n",
[10235]="70047BEB\n1\tCollect relics of Dol Acharn (total: 8)\tRelics can be found throughout Dol Acharn in eastern Dagorlad. You have arrived at Dol Acharn and discovered relics that might be of interest to Artamir. You should gather them and deliver them to him when you are able.\n2\tDeliver the relics to Artamir at Haerondir\tArtamir can be found at Haerondir in the Wastes. You have gathered many relics from Dol Acharn and should now deliver them to Artamir at Haerondir.\n",
[10236]="70022728\n1\tDefeat giants to recover a relic\tThe giant encampments may be found far to the south of Zudrugund. Frithgeir has asked you to recover a relic from the giants in Thrór's Coomb.\n2\tDefeat giants to recover relics\tThe giant encampments may be found far to the south of Zudrugund. Frithgeir has asked you to recover a relic from the giants in Thrór's Coomb.\n3\tTalk to Frithgeir at Zudrugund\tFrithgeir is at Zudrugund, north of the giant encampments. You should bring the relic that you recovered to Frithgeir.\n",
[10237]="7004E4F6\n1\tAid injured guards (total: 8)\tGuards have become injured in the fight against the Jangovar, outside Hammerstead. You should aid injured guards.\n2\tTalk to Lóssi\tYou should talk to Lóssi, who can be found defending Hammerstead.\n",
[10238]="70015E3A\n1\tBring the recovered supplies to Daegennan\030Collect satchels (total: 6)\030Collect crates (total: 6)\tDaegennan believes that more of the lost supplies may be found along the path from Rivendell, well to the east of Gwingris. Daegennan has asked you to recover more of the missing supplies.\n",
[10239]="7002C5A6\n1\tExamine remains for signs of innocent victims (total: 4)\030Examine remains for signs of animal victims (total: 4)\tRemain-piles can be found throughout the Nighthowlers' Den in Eorlsmead, east along the river from Stangard. You should examine remains in the den for signs whether innocent passers-by have fallen victim to the wild dogs.\n2\tReturn to Sabert\tSabert is at the north gate of Stangard. You should return to Stangard with news of the human remains in the lairs of the wild dogs.\n",
[10240]="70064515\n1\tTalk to Indagir\tIndagir asks you for your aid in delving into Thaurisgar, the Vile Apothecary. You should speak to Indagir if you wish to help him. Indagir can be found in Bail Avarc, outside of Carn Dûm.\n2\tFind Indagir within Thaurisgar\tIndagir has asked you to find him within Thaurisgar, the Vile Apothecary. Use the Instance Finder to enter Thaurisgar, the Vile Apothecary.\n3\tFind a way to the lower level\tIndagir has asked you to clear a path before you can delve any further into the apothecary. Find your way to the lower level.\n4\tProceed further into the apothecary\tYou have found your way to the lower level apothecaries. But Indagir is nowhere to be found. You should clear the path ahead and find Indagir.\n5\tUnlock the gate\tThe gate has opened. You should explore the main hall of the apothecary and try to find Indagir.\n6\tIndagir must be in the main hall\tYou have found Indagir in the main hall of Thaurisgar. But it looks like the most twisted experiments block his path.\n7\tDefeat the Twins - Kurja and Karsija\tYou have defeated the Twins, but it seems Indagir was just using you to get what he wanted.\n8\tTalk to Torvendor in Thaurisgar\tTorvendor witnessed Indagir's betrayal. He was suspicious of him from the start. You should speak to Torvendor. Torvendor can be found in Bail Avarc outside of Carn Dûm.\n",
})
